{"ref":"passive:wings","lead":[{"k":"p","c":["Wings are a passive item in Vampire Survivors. They are unlocked by reaching Level 5 as any character."]},{"k":"p","c":["Wings increase ",{"t":"Move Speed","r":"powerup:move-speed"}," by 10% per level."]},{"k":"p","c":["Wings are required for the evolution of ",{"t":"Shadow Pinion","r":"weapon:shadow-pinion"},", ",{"t":"Valkyrie Turner","r":"weapon:valkyrie-turner"},", and for the evolution of ",{"t":"Glass Fandango","r":"weapon:glass-fandango"},", ",{"t":"Celestial Voulge","r":"weapon:celestial-voulge"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["Wings can be found as a stage item in ",{"t":"Dairy Plant","r":"stage:dairy-plant"},", ",{"t":"Moongolow","r":"stage:moongolow"},", ",{"t":"Boss Rash","r":"stage:boss-rash"},", ",{"t":"Whiteout","r":"stage:whiteout"},", and ",{"t":"Tiny Bridge","r":"stage:tiny-bridge"},"."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Passive item","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["27 October 2021 (Update)"]]},{"label":"ID","cells":[["MOVESPEED"]]},{"label":"Player stat","cells":[[{"t":"Move Speed","r":"powerup:move-speed"}]]},{"label":"Rarity","cells":[["50"]]},{"label":"Max level","cells":[["5"]]},{"label":"Bonus per level","cells":[["+10%"]]},{"label":"Stacking","cells":[["Additive"]]},{"label":"Max effect","cells":[["+50%"]]},{"label":"Stage item","cells":[[{"t":"Dairy Plant","r":"stage:dairy-plant"},", ",{"t":"Moongolow","r":"stage:moongolow"},", ",{"t":"Boss Rash","r":"stage:boss-rash"},", ",{"t":"Tiny Bridge","r":"stage:tiny-bridge"}]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"levels","title":"Levels","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Wings have 5 levels. At max level, Wings provide +50% ",{"t":"Move Speed","r":"powerup:move-speed"},"."]},{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["Level"],"h":1},{"c":["Description"],"h":1}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 1"]},{"c":["\"Character moves 10% faster.\""]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 2"]},{"c":["Movement speed increases by 10%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 3"]},{"c":["Movement speed increases by 10%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 4"]},{"c":["Movement speed increases by 10%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 5"]},{"c":["Movement speed increases by 10%"]}]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"evolutions","title":"Evolutions","blocks":[{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["Base weapon"],"h":1},{"c":[],"h":1},{"c":["Passive item"],"h":1},{"c":[],"h":1},{"c":["Evolution"],"h":1}]},{"cells":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Shadow_Pinion.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:shadow-pinion"},"\n",{"t":"Shadow Pinion","r":"weapon:shadow-pinion"}]},{"c":["+"]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Wings.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"passive:wings"},"\nWings"]},{"c":["="]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Valkyrie_Turner.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:valkyrie-turner"},"\n",{"t":"Valkyrie Turner","r":"weapon:valkyrie-turner"}]}]},{"cells":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Glass_Fandango.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:glass-fandango"},"\n",{"t":"Glass Fandango","r":"weapon:glass-fandango"}]},{"c":["+"]},{"c":["Max level:\n",{"i":"Sprite-Wings.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"passive:wings"},"\nWings"]},{"c":["="]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Celestial_Voulge.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:celestial-voulge"},"\n",{"t":"Celestial Voulge","r":"weapon:celestial-voulge"}]}]},{"cells":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Prism_Lass.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:prism-lass"},"\n",{"t":"Prism Lass","r":"weapon:prism-lass"}]},{"c":["+"]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Wings.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"passive:wings"},"\nWings+",{"i":"Sprite-Weapon_Power-Up.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"passive:weapon-power-up"},"\n",{"t":"Weapon Power-Up","r":"passive:weapon-power-up"}]},{"c":["="]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Time_Warp.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:time-warp"},"\n",{"t":"Time Warp","r":"weapon:time-warp"}]}]},{"cells":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Alucard_Spear.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:alucard-spear"},"\n",{"t":"Alucard Spear","r":"weapon:alucard-spear"}]},{"c":["+"]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Wings.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"passive:wings"},"\nWings"]},{"c":["="]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Thunderbolt_Spear.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:thunderbolt-spear"},"\n",{"t":"Thunderbolt Spear","r":"weapon:thunderbolt-spear"}]}]},{"cells":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Sonic_Dash.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:sonic-dash"},"\n",{"t":"Sonic Dash","r":"weapon:sonic-dash"}]},{"c":["+"]},{"c":["Max level:\n",{"i":"Sprite-Wings.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"passive:wings"},"\nWings"]},{"c":["="]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Rapidus_Fio.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:rapidus-fio"},"\n",{"t":"Rapidus Fio","r":"weapon:rapidus-fio"}]}]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"tips","title":"Tips","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Wings do not have much usage, and are essentially a personal preference. Movement speed is arguably not as important as bonuses to your weapons or experience gain though."]},{"c":[{"t":"Peachone","r":"weapon:peachone"},", ",{"t":"Ebony Wings","r":"weapon:ebony-wings"},", and ",{"t":"Vandalier","r":"weapon:vandalier"}," move faster depending on Movement Speed bonuses. However, it does not have any tangible bonus to the power of the weapons as they already aim at the bombarding circle no matter the distance."]},{"c":[{"t":"La Borra","r":"weapon:la-borra"},"'s attacks moves and expands faster with both higher ",{"t":"Speed","r":"powerup:speed"}," and Move Speed, with Movement Speed giving a bigger boost."]},{"c":[{"t":"Shadow Pinion","r":"weapon:shadow-pinion"},", ",{"t":"Valkyrie Turner","r":"weapon:valkyrie-turner"},", and ",{"t":"Celestial Dusting","r":"weapon:celestial-dusting"}," shoot out extra projectiles based on the character animation changes. Movement Speed increases the rate of the animation changing thus increases the overall fire rate of the weapon. Note that it does not affect ",{"t":"Cooldown","r":"powerup:cooldown"}," of them and the base Cooldown is quite high at 6 s."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Wings_(Old).png","w":120,"h":120,"c":["The old design of the Wings/Move Speed icon."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 27 October 2021 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]}]}